//   (1) wrong AE. That text is Caustic Mist 2814 / Putrefy Flesh 1956, and the
//       guild already owns it with a plain "Putrefy Flesh" trigger.
//   (2) burst_n 3 wanted three DISTINCT victims' land lines inside one log.
